      "edition": "Sunday 11 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Form watch",
          "heading": "England lock Alex Coles scores and plays wing in Northampton's 71-48 win",
          "body": "Alex Coles popped up on the wing for Northampton, made metres, trucked hard in the tight exchanges, ran the lineout and scored a try in the 71-48 win over Bath. Planet Rugby's winners list says his form has carried on from the end of last season into the new campaign, and that it will leave Steve Borthwick beaming. Coles's wing cameo is a useful reminder of his range for November."
        },
