          "heading": "Bundee Aki's 'lippy' outburst as Connacht are mauled 36-19 by Glasgow",
          "body": "URC: Connacht were beaten 36-19 at Scotstoun on Friday, with four of Glasgow's five tries coming from the maul and Planet Rugby describing the visitors as 'mauled to death'. Bundee Aki's latest 'lippy' outburst is the side story, but the sobering stat is that Connacht last won away at Glasgow at Firhill in September 2010."
