          "heading": "Italy sit 11th of 12 after three defeats, conceding 131 points",
          "body": "Italy go into the weekend 11th of 12 in the log after three defeats from three matches, scoring 37 points and conceding 131. Points difference stands at -94. Their most recent result was a 10-57 loss to Australia in Round 3, and next up is South Africa in Round 4. Italy's best world ranking remains No. 8, reached in 2007 and 2024."
