          "kicker": "Concussion litigation",
          "heading": "World Rugby loses bid to strike out brain injury claims",
          "body": "The legal action over concussion and brain injuries in rugby remains open, with claimants reported to face a £2.8m legal bill to continue the case. Earlier, in August, World Rugby and UK bodies lost a bid to have the brain injury cases thrown out of court. No settlement or further ruling has been reported since, so the case stays open until the claimants settle their fees or it is resolved."
        },
