          "kicker": "Selection push",
          "heading": "Tommy Reffell presses Wales starting case with breakdown display for Leicester",
          "body": "In the Premiership, Leicester flanker Tommy Reffell made the strongest case for a Wales starting shirt in Friday's 38-31 win over Gloucester, according to Planet Rugby's winners-and-losers verdict. He was a nuisance at the breakdown all evening, and his try-saving tackle on Will Joseph on 65 minutes was vital. The display was framed as pressing his claim ahead of Wales' November Nations Championship block."
        },
