      "edition": "Sunday 11 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Coaching staff",
          "heading": "Mario Ledesma returns as Los Pumas forwards coach through 2027 World Cup",
          "body": "Mario Ledesma is back at Los Pumas as forwards coach until the end of the 2027 World Cup in Australia, the Argentine Rugby Union has confirmed. The former hooker won 84 Tests between 1996 and 2011 and coached Argentina from 2018 to 2022. \"I am honoured and very grateful for the opportunity to work with Los Pumas again,\" Ledesma said. He and Shaun Edwards start work with the Pumas at the end of October, ahead of the November Nations Championship matches."
        },
