          "body": "In the United Rugby Championship, the Bulls beat the Lions 57-15 on Saturday, and the returning Springboks did much of the damage. Johan Ackermann started Grobbelaar, Steenekamp, Hanekom and Moodie, and all four stood out. Van Staden, Wiese, Louw and Pollard made their impact from the bench, with Pollard also slotting three conversions. The Bulls led 31-10 at half-time after a yellow card to Lions scrum-half Morne van den Berg."
